{"id":"event_beautyfullshot1_01_s","cat":"event","group":{"id":"ev40051","label":"BEAUTY FULL SHOT · Part 1"},"label":"You're Out!: A","stage":null,"prev":"event_beautyfullshot1_prologue","next":"event_beautyfullshot1_01_e","speakers":{"femaleannouncer":"Female Announcer","sakura":"Sakura","rosanna":"Rosanna","moran":"Moran"},"icons":{"femaleannouncer":"si_c999_00_s","sakura":"si_c282_00_s","rosanna":"si_c280_00_s","moran":"si_c281_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"event_beautyfullshot1_01_s_1","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_beautyfullshot1_01_s_1","text":"A few days ago. Downtown in the Ark.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"City_d","bgArt":"city_d","image":null,"bgm":"bgm_story_fairytalesend_if","movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_beautyfullshot1_01_s_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"femaleannouncer","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_beautyfullshot1_01_s_2","text":"Unidentified armed groups are causing panic in the downtown area.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_beautyfullshot1_01_s_3","type":"Speech","speaker":"femaleannouncer","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_beautyfullshot1_01_s_3","text":"The Central Government has identified the perpetrators as a terrorist group, and has announced they are preparing to suppress them.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_beautyfullshot1_01_s_4","type":"Speech","speaker":"femaleannouncer","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_beautyfullshot1_01_s_4","text":"The terrorists are armed with the latest weaponry available, and the confrontation is expected to be tumultuous. Access to the downtown area has therefore been restricted...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_beautyfullshot1_01_s_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"sakura","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_beautyfullshot1_01_s_5","text":"This isn't good.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":["sakura","rosanna","moran"],"affinity":null},{"id":"event_beautyfullshot1_01_s_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"rosanna","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_beautyfullshot1_01_s_6","text":"Not good at all.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_beautyfullshot1_01_s_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"rosanna","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_beautyfullshot1_01_s_7","text":"And now they're broadcasting it for all to see. Those fools.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_beautyfullshot1_01_s_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"sakura","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_beautyfullshot1_01_s_8","text":"This will only make them more anxious.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_beautyfullshot1_01_s_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"rosanna","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_beautyfullshot1_01_s_9","text":"I don't think they wanted to drag this out anyway, but what they're doing now is goading us into action.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_beautyfullshot1_01_s_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"sakura","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_beautyfullshot1_01_s_10","text":"I'll go buy us some time.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_beautyfullshot1_01_s_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"rosanna","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_beautyfullshot1_01_s_11","text":"For how long? Until the Central Government's lackeys come running?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_beautyfullshot1_01_s_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"rosanna","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_beautyfullshot1_01_s_12","text":"By the time the A.C.P.U. or Triangle gets there, it'll be too late.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_beautyfullshot1_01_s_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"rosanna","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_beautyfullshot1_01_s_13","text":"We have to apprehend them now.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_beautyfullshot1_01_s_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"moran","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_beautyfullshot1_01_s_14","text":"Alright, then let's go.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_beautyfullshot1_01_s_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"sakura","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_beautyfullshot1_01_s_15","text":"Stand down, Moran. I know how capable your subordinates are, but you're in over your head.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_beautyfullshot1_01_s_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"sakura","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_beautyfullshot1_01_s_16","text":"These people are armed and dangerous.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_beautyfullshot1_01_s_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"moran","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_beautyfullshot1_01_s_17","text":"Those peashooters of theirs don't stand a chance against me.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_beautyfullshot1_01_s_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"moran","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_beautyfullshot1_01_s_18","text":"Their bullets will just bounce off me as I pummel them.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_beautyfullshot1_01_s_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"sakura","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_beautyfullshot1_01_s_19","text":"*Sigh*...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_beautyfullshot1_01_s_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"rosanna","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_beautyfullshot1_01_s_20","text":"I implore you to reconsider. Think for a second. Do you want to advertise to everyone that you are a Nikke?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_beautyfullshot1_01_s_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"moran","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_beautyfullshot1_01_s_21","text":"Oh yeah, you're right...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_beautyfullshot1_01_s_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"sakura","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_beautyfullshot1_01_s_22","text":"They're on the move.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_beautyfullshot1_01_s_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"rosanna","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_beautyfullshot1_01_s_23","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_beautyfullshot1_01_s_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"rosanna","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_beautyfullshot1_01_s_24","text":"It looks to me like they intend on taking hostages.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_beautyfullshot1_01_s_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"moran","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_beautyfullshot1_01_s_25","text":"What?! They're getting civilians involved in this?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_beautyfullshot1_01_s_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"moran","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_beautyfullshot1_01_s_26","text":"Those cowards! I oughta...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_beautyfullshot1_01_s_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"sakura","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_beautyfullshot1_01_s_27","text":"If they take hostages, that will complicate matters.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_beautyfullshot1_01_s_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"sakura","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_beautyfullshot1_01_s_28","text":"It could lead to civilian casualties.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_beautyfullshot1_01_s_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"rosanna","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_beautyfullshot1_01_s_29","text":"I realize that.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_beautyfullshot1_01_s_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"rosanna","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_beautyfullshot1_01_s_30","text":"We have no choice.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_beautyfullshot1_01_s_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"rosanna","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_beautyfullshot1_01_s_31","text":"We have to wipe them out.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_beautyfullshot1_01_s_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"sakura","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_beautyfullshot1_01_s_32","text":"You say we don't have a choice, but you seem awfully thrilled about it.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_beautyfullshot1_01_s_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"rosanna","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_beautyfullshot1_01_s_33","text":"Is this not the simplest course of action?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_beautyfullshot1_01_s_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"sakura","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_beautyfullshot1_01_s_34","text":"It is, I'll give you that.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_beautyfullshot1_01_s_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"moran","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_beautyfullshot1_01_s_35","text":"Okay then, let's go...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_beautyfullshot1_01_s_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"rosanna","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_beautyfullshot1_01_s_36","text":"Would you hold your horses for a damn minute? You can't go out there.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_beautyfullshot1_01_s_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"moran","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_beautyfullshot1_01_s_37","text":"Shouldn't a general be on the frontlines of a skirmish?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_beautyfullshot1_01_s_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"rosanna","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_beautyfullshot1_01_s_38","text":"Why put yourself in harm's way when you can have your subordinates do the fighting?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_beautyfullshot1_01_s_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"rosanna","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_beautyfullshot1_01_s_39","text":"Ah, I get it. You probably never considered that because you command too small a number.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_beautyfullshot1_01_s_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"moran","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_beautyfullshot1_01_s_40","text":"Hey, what you are implying?!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_beautyfullshot1_01_s_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"sakura","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_beautyfullshot1_01_s_41","text":"We can't get involved. If this gets out, we'll be in for a world of hurt.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_beautyfullshot1_01_s_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"sakura","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_beautyfullshot1_01_s_42","text":"Moran, I have an important task for you. Stay by the backdoor and keep an eye out for any stragglers.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_beautyfullshot1_01_s_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"sakura","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_beautyfullshot1_01_s_43","text":"If any of them manage to escape, things could escalate unnecessarily.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_beautyfullshot1_01_s_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"moran","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_beautyfullshot1_01_s_44","text":"Oh, okay! I'm on it!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_beautyfullshot1_01_s_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"sakura","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_beautyfullshot1_01_s_45","text":"I trust that you'll do a fine job.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_beautyfullshot1_01_s_46","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_beautyfullshot1_01_s_46","text":"Moran darts off hurriedly.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_beautyfullshot1_01_s_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"rosanna","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_beautyfullshot1_01_s_47","text":"I see you're quite adept at keeping her in line.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_beautyfullshot1_01_s_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"sakura","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_beautyfullshot1_01_s_48","text":"Whatever do you mean?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_beautyfullshot1_01_s_49","type":"Speech","speaker":"rosanna","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_beautyfullshot1_01_s_49","text":"I don't believe that 